    "html": "<p>The relative speed of reference frame <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"S\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"S'\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.70c\"></span>. The Lorentz factor for this relative speed is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.4\"></span>. Frame <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"S'\"></span> is moving in the direction of the positive <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span>-axis of frame <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"S\"></span>. At <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 0\"></span> the origins of the two frames coincide. The spacetime coordinates of events P and Q as measured in frame <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"S\"></span> are as follows:</p>\n<p>Event P: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x_{P} = 110\\;\\textup{m}\"></span>, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"y_{P} = z_{P} = 0\"></span>, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t_{P} = 0.75\\;\\mu \\textup{s}\"></span></p>\n<p>Event Q: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x_{Q} = 160\\;\\textup{m}\"></span>, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"y_{Q} = z_{Q} = 0\"></span>, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t_{Q} = 0.85\\;\\mu \\textup{s}\"></span></p>\n<p>What is the best estimate for the distance between events P and Q as measured in frame <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"S'\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"25\\;\\textup{m}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"35\\;\\textup{m}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"41\\;\\textup{m}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"46\\;\\textup{m}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
